# Always ship to main

When a change is done, commit it and `git push origin HEAD` to `origin/main` without asking first.

- Do not wait for “have you pushed?”
- After a push that should go live, confirm the Vercel production deploy (or trigger a redeploy if only env vars changed)
- Skip empty commits. Do not commit secrets (`.env`, tokens, keys)
- Destructive git (`push --force` to main, hard reset) still requires an explicit request
